 748:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu.c **** /**
 749:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu.c ****  *  @brief      Initialize hardware.
 750:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu.c ****  *  Initial configuration:\n
 751:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu.c ****  *  Gyro FSR: +/- 2000DPS\n
 752:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu.c ****  *  Accel FSR +/- 2G\n
 753:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu.c ****  *  DLPF: 42Hz\n
