 880:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu.c ****  *  the accelerometer at one of the following frequencies:
 881:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu.c ****  *  \n MPU6050: 1.25Hz, 5Hz, 20Hz, 40Hz
 882:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu.c ****  *  \n MPU6500: 1.25Hz, 2.5Hz, 5Hz, 10Hz, 20Hz, 40Hz, 80Hz, 160Hz, 320Hz, 640Hz
 883:Modules/mpu6050/inv_mpu.c ****  *  \n If the requested rate is not one listed above, the device will be set to
